  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Conjuration Sphere, Warp Sphere (Teleport Beacon)</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Creatures that are your teleport beacons are considered to be conjuration companions for the purpose of the Link, Otherworldly Audience, Spell Conduit, and Spell-Linked Companion talents. Whenever you summon a companion, you may summon a willing teleport beacon creature in place of a companion.</p>\n<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Card Casting Bonus Content</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/general-feats#toc67\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
